{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_operator_selection","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_operator_selection","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":34,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_operator_selection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_operator_selection","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L189-L206","doc":"**Content statement.** The confinement operator is the crossing-minimal\nnontrivial Brunnian `n`-braid: it exists iff `n ≥ 3` (baryon/meson\ndichotomy), is the unique-by-minimality Brunnian selection, and at `n = 3`\nequals the Borromean braid `𝓑₃ = (σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-operator-selection","label":"prop:confinement-operator-selection","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/confinement-operator-selection.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.confine_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.confine_three","kind":"theorem","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L187-L187","doc":"Sub-claim — the `n = 3` topological selection is the Borromean braid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.borromean_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.borromean_identity","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L185-L185","doc":"Sub-claim — definitional identity `𝓑₃ = (σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.borromean_word","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.borromean_word","kind":"def","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L183-L183","doc":"The braid word `(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³ ∈ H₃(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.B3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.B3","kind":"def","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L181-L181","doc":"The Borromean operator `𝓑₃ ∈ H₃(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.rep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.rep","kind":"def","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L179-L179","doc":"Image of a braid under the Hecke representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.HeckeAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.HeckeAlgebra","kind":"def","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L177-L177","doc":"The Hecke algebra `H₃(q)` carrier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.mk","kind":"ctor","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L175-L175","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.toBrunnianConfinement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement.toBrunnianConfinement","kind":"def","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L175-L187","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanConfinement","kind":"class","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L173-L187","doc":"The `n = 3` (baryon) specialisation: the confinement operator is the\nBorromean braid `𝓑₃ = (σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³` in the Hecke algebra `H₃(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.is_minimal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.is_minimal","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L171-L171","doc":"The selected confinement braid is crossing-minimal among Brunnian ones. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.is_brunnian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.is_brunnian","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L169-L169","doc":"The selected confinement braid is Brunnian. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.is_nontrivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.is_nontrivial","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L167-L167","doc":"The selected confinement braid is nontrivial. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.three_le_impl_exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.three_le_impl_exists","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L165-L165","doc":"Confinement exists if n >= 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.exists_impl_three_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.exists_impl_three_le","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L163-L163","doc":"Confinement exists only if n >= 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.confine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.confine","kind":"def","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L161-L161","doc":"The selected confinement braid on `n` strands, when one exists. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.crossings","kind":"def","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L159-L159","doc":"Diagram crossing number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.Brunnian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.Brunnian","kind":"def","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L157-L157","doc":"Every proper sublink of the closure is the unlink (Brunnian). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.Nontrivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.Nontrivial","kind":"def","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L155-L155","doc":"The closure is a nontrivial link (not the unlink). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.Braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.Braid","kind":"def","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L153-L153","doc":"Braids on `n` strands. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement.mk","kind":"ctor","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L151-L151","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BrunnianConfinement","kind":"class","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L149-L171","doc":"General topological confinement selection. A confined `n`-quark bound state\nis the closure of the crossing-minimal nontrivial **Brunnian** `n`-braid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean_sublinks_trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean_sublinks_trivial","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L134-L145","doc":"**Brunnian property — decidable core, machine-proved.** Deleting any one of\nthe three strands from the Borromean braid leaves a 2-braid that is trivial\nin `B₂ ≅ ℤ` (exponent sum `0`; concretely each induced word is `σ σ⁻¹`).\nBecause `B₂` is free abelian on one generator, exponent-sum-`0` is exactly\ntriviality, so each 2-sublink closure is the 2-component **unlink** — i.e.\nremoving any quark frees the other two. This proves the *full* Brunnian\nproperty modulo the textbook facts `B₂ ≅ ℤ` and \"a trivial 2-braid closes to\nthe unlink\"; only crossing-minimality (the finite enumeration,\n`b3_brunnian_minimality_enumeration.py`) remains witnessed-not-proved. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.b2class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.b2class","kind":"def","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L131-L132","doc":"`B₂ ≅ ℤ` class (exponent sum) of the induced 2-braid after deleting strand `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.deleteStrand","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.deleteStrand","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L117-L129","doc":"The 2-braid induced on the surviving strands by deleting strand `k`, as the\nlist of signed crossings between the two survivors. Since `B₂ ≅ ℤ` (one\ngenerator), this 2-braid is determined up to braid equivalence by its\nexponent sum (`b2class`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean_crossing_counts","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean_crossing_counts","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L112-L115","doc":"**Geometric nontriviality** (machine-proved): every pair of strands crosses\ntwice — pairwise unlinked (`lk = 0`) yet interwoven, the Borromean hallmark. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean_linking_signature","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean_linking_signature","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L107-L110","doc":"**Brunnian linking signature** (machine-proved): every pairwise linking\nnumber of the Borromean braid vanishes (`2·lk = 0` per pair). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.crossingCounts","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.crossingCounts","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L92-L105","doc":"The three pairwise unsigned crossing counts. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.signedCrossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.signedCrossings","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L88-L90","doc":"The three pairwise signed crossing sums (`= 2·lk` per pair). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.step","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L78-L86","doc":"One braid letter: cross the two strands at the generator's positions\n(recording the signed crossing) then swap them. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.addPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.addPair","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L71-L76","doc":"Add signed crossing `s` to the accumulator slot for the unordered pair {x,y}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.Pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.Pos","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L68-L69","doc":"Strand occupying each of the 3 positions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.borromean","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L64-L66","doc":"The Borromean braid word `(σ₀ σ₁⁻¹)³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.Letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BraidModel.Letter","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_operator_selection.lean#L61-L62","doc":"A 3-braid letter: generator index (`0`/`1`) and sign (`true` = positive). ","signatureChunk":0}]}